    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d37">

                <pb facs="0104" n="82" sameAs="frus:frus1951v02/pg82"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">330/9–1351: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Greece</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Peurifoy</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Athens</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-09-13T11:00:00+02:00">September 13,
                            1951—11 a.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1239. Re Deptel 1213, Sept 10, we have discussed matter with FonOff which is
                    cabling Kyrou to make strong attempt rally other UN delegates to Greece’s
                    support. FonOff is aware that we wld be prepared to support Grk candidacy but
                    cld hardly do so usefully unless other backing developed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peurifoy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
